#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:3
msgid "Numark Mixtrack (Pro) 3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:5
msgid ""
"[Manufacturer’s product page](https://www.numark.com/product/mixtrack-pro-3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:6
msgid ""
"[Manufacturer's User "
"Manual](https://www.numark.com/images/product_downloads/MixtrackPro3-UserGuide-v1.1.pdf)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:7
msgid "[Forum thread](https://mixxx.discourse.group/t/mixtrack-pro-3/15165)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:9
msgid ""
"The Numark Mixtrack 3 and Numark Mixtrack Pro 3 are the same controller "
"except that the Pro version has an integrated 4 channel output sound card "
"and costs $50 more. If you use the non-Pro version, you would need a "
"{ref}`splitter cable <hardware-splitter-cables>` or {ref}`separate audio "
"interface <hardware-audio-interfaces>` to be able to preview tracks in "
"headphones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:16
msgid ""
"The microphone input on the Pro version is not available to the computer "
"through the controller’s sound card. It is mixed with the main output in "
"hardware, so this controller’s sound card is not suitable for broadcasting "
"or recording the inputs. If you want to use the controller for broadcasting "
"or recording, getting the non-Pro version with a separate {ref}`audio "
"interface <hardware-audio-interfaces>` with a microphone input is suggested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:27
msgid "Mapping Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:37
msgid "Numark Mixtrack (Pro) 3 (schematic view)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:40
msgid "1. Browser Knob"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:42
msgid ""
"Rotate this knob to cycle through tracks in main library window. Press   the"
" Knob to expand library view.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+ Turn:** allows "
"selecting Play Lists and side navigation bar items.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+"
" Push:** opens / closes selected side navigation bar item."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:47
msgid ""
"**Configurable option:** In Focus mode the Browse encoder affects the "
"library widget which currently has keyboard focus. This requires the Mixxx "
"window to have focus and allows to control the searchbar, too. In Classic "
"mode the Browse encoder can select items in the sidebar and tracks table "
"only, but independent of keyboard focus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:54
msgid "2. Master Gain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:56
msgid ""
"Adjusts the main volume in the software.<br> **Note**: This control does not"
" affect the microphone volume which is   summed with the final output of the"
" main gain to the main output.   Use the Mic Gain knob to control the "
"microphone volume."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:61
msgid "3. Cue Mix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:63
msgid ""
"Adjusts the software’s audio output to the headphones, mixing between the "
"cue (PFL) output and the main mix output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:66
msgid "4. Cue Gain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:68
msgid "Adjusts the volume for headphone cueing in the software."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:70
msgid "5. Load"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:72
msgid ""
"Press one of these buttons while a track is selected in the library window "
"to assign it to Deck 1 and 2, respectively, in the software.<br> "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`LOAD`: Activates Fader Start mode for the "
"corresponding (PFL Button is then blinking).<br> Fader start guide: In fader"
" start mode,   not only you can press the play/pause button to play/pause "
"the track,   but if you move up the level fader (the volume fader if you "
"prefer) of   the deck, the track will be played and if you close it to zero,"
" the   track will be paused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:80
msgid ""
"**Configurable option:** If the smartPFL option is set to true, the Cue/PFL "
"button is automatically activated on the deck being loaded and deactivated "
"on the other deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:84
msgid "6. High EQ Knobs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:86
msgid ""
"Adjust High frequencies of the deck<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`HIGH`: "
"Adjust parameter 1 of the currently focused effect on this deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:89
msgid "7. Mid EQ Knobs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:91
msgid ""
"Adjust Mid frequencies of the deck<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`MID`: "
"Adjust parameter 2 of the currently focused effect on this deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:94
msgid "8 Low EQ Knobs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:96
msgid ""
"Adjust Low frequencies of the deck<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`LOW`: "
"Adjust parameter 3 of the currently focused effect on this deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:99
msgid "9. Filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:101
msgid ""
"Adjusts the amount of the filter effect. Turning the knob left controls the "
"low pass filter; turning it right controls the high pass filter.<br> "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FILTER`: Adjust parameter 4 of the currently "
"focused effect on this deck.<br> If effect is unfocused then;<br> "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FILTER` Adjust the gain of the deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:106
msgid ""
"**Configurable option:** Adjust FX parameter 4 (default) or deck gain when "
"unfocused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:109
msgid "10. Cue/PFL/Headphones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:111
msgid ""
"Sends pre-fader audio to the headphone output {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + "
"{hwlabel}`CUE/PFL`: Toggle quantize mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:114
msgid "11. Volume fader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:116
msgid "Adjusts the volume of the deck"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:118
msgid "12. Crossfader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:120
msgid "Controls the blend between the two decks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:122
msgid "13-14. Pitch Bend Down/Up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:124
msgid ""
"Press and hold to momentarily reduce the speed of the track.<br> "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + **PITCH BEND** {hwlabel}`-`/{hwlabel}`+`: Jump 1 beat "
"backward/forward.<br>  \\- If loop is activated, move loop by beatjump "
"amount instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:128
msgid "15. Pitch Fader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:130
msgid ""
"Adjust the speed of the music (activate keylock to adjust tempo without "
"affecting pitch). Note that moving the fader down *increases* speed, as "
"marked by the “+” at the bottom of the fader on the controller. This can be "
"reversed in Mixxx’s preferences under Interface > Speed slider direction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:136
msgid "16. Touch Strip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:138
msgid ""
"Use the Touch Strip to adjust the deck’s Effect Unit Superknob. If Effects "
"are assigned to Instant FX , they will be enabled instantly on touch, and "
"disabled on finger lift.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + **Touch Strip**: search "
"through a track’s timeline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:141
msgid "17. Beats Multiplier"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:143
msgid ""
"Adjusts the Dry/Wet mix of the deck’s Effect Unit<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + "
"{hwlabel}`BEATS`: Moves the beat grid left (turn counterclockwise) or right "
"(turn clockwise)<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`BEATS`: Adjust beatjump "
"amount<br> {hwlabel}`PADMODE` + {hwlabel}`BEATS`: Adjust Sampler Volume.   "
"Left beat knob will adjust Samplers 1-4; Right knob will adjust Samplers 5-8"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:149
msgid "18. FX 1 On/Off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:151
msgid ""
"Turns FX1 on and off<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FX1`: Select from the "
"list of available effects for the respective effect.<br> {hwlabel}`PADMODE` "
"+ {hwlabel}`FX1`: Assign / unassign FX 1 to Instant FX. When assigned to "
"Instant FX, the FX is instantly activated by touching the Strip and stopped "
"when finger is lifted.<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + {hwlabel}`FX1`: Focus this "
"effect to allow adjusting its metaknob with the touch strip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:156
msgid "19. FX 2 On/Off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:158
msgid ""
"Turns FX2 on and off<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FX2`: Select from the "
"list of available effects for the respective effect.<br> {hwlabel}`PADMODE` "
"+ {hwlabel}`FX2`: Assign / unassign FX 1 to Instant FX. When assigned to "
"Instant FX, the FX is instantly activated by touching the Strip and stopped "
"when finger is lifted.<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + {hwlabel}`FX2`: Focus this "
"effect to allow adjusting its metaknob with the touch strip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:163
msgid "20. FX 3 On/Off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:165
msgid ""
"Turns FX3 on and off<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FX3`: Select from the "
"list of available effects for the respective effect.<br> {hwlabel}`PADMODE` "
"+ {hwlabel}`FX3`: Assign / unassign FX 1 to Instant FX. When assigned to "
"Instant FX, the FX is instantly activated by touching the Strip and stopped "
"when finger is lifted.<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + {hwlabel}`FX3`: Focus this "
"effect to allow adjusting its metaknob with the touch strip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:170
msgid "21. Tap BPM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:172
msgid ""
"Press this 8 or more times on beat to manually enter a new BPM. The   "
"software will ignore the track’s BPM and follow your manually entered   "
"tempo.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`TAP`: Toggles deck between deck 1-3 "
"(left side) or deck 2-4   (right side). TAP LED will be RED when deck 3 is "
"active (Left Tap) or   deck 4 is active (Right Tap)<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + "
"{hwlabel}`HOTCUE 1`: Activates Brake effect<br> {hwlabel}`TAP` + "
"{hwlabel}`HOTCUE 2`: Activates Spinback effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:181
msgid "22. Wheel button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:183
msgid ""
"Activate this button to use the platter/jog wheel to grab and move the   "
"audio, scratching the track like a vinyl record.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + "
"{hwlabel}`WHEEL`: Toggle slip mode on/off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:187
msgid ""
"**Configurable option**: The jog wheel button flashes near the end of a "
"track by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:189
msgid "23. Platter/Jog Wheel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:191
msgid ""
"**Touch side:** Pitch bend (nudging) if track is playing (Wheel On   "
"(always) & Wheel Off - if   PitchBendOnWheelOff configuration option   is "
"true) and / track positioning (Wheel On)<br> {hwlabel}`WHEEL` **On** + "
"**Touch platter**: scratching: touch the platter and move it<br> "
"{hwlabel}`WHEEL` **Off** + **Touch platter**: If track is not playing, "
"allows   positioning the track<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`WHEEL` "
"**Off** + **Touch platter**: fast seek through track<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + "
"{hwlabel}`WHEEL` **On** + **Touch platter**: iCut mode: simulates a scratch"
"   routine with the jog wheel. When the jog wheel is turned back, the   "
"crossfader closes; when the jog wheel is turned forward the crossfader   "
"will open. As a visual reference, TAP LED and Wheel button LED will be   ON."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:205
msgid ""
"**Configurable Options:** The iCutEnabled and fastSeekEnabled options can be"
" used to turn off iCut and fast seeking. These options may be helpful to "
"avoid accidentally using these features when touching the platter with shift"
" lock on. The PitchBendOnWheelOff option allows pitch bending using the jog "
"wheel even when the scratch mode is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:211
msgid "24. Shift"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:213
msgid ""
"Allows multiple control commands to be triggered when pressed first   along "
"with other buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:216
msgid "25. Pad Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:218
msgid ""
"This is used to change the operation mode of the {ref}`top 4 performance "
"pads <numark-mixtrack-pro-3-performance-pads>`. Pressing this button will "
"light the pad indicating the currently active mode (Manual Loop, Auto Loop "
"or Sampler)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:222
msgid "26. Sync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:224
msgid ""
"Enables BPM syncing between decks.<br> **Short Press:** Press once to "
"synchronize the tempo (BPM) to that of   to that of the other track<br> "
"**Double Press:** press twice QUICKLY to play the track immediately   "
"synchronized to the tempo (BPM) and to the phase of the other track,   if "
"the track was paused<br> **Long Press** (Sync Lock): Hold for at least half "
"of a second to   enable sync lock for this deck. Decks with sync locked will"
" all play   at the same tempo, and decks that also have quantize enabled "
"will   always have their beats lined up. If the Sync Lock was previously   "
"activated, it just deactivates it regardless of the Short press/Double   "
"Press<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`SYNC`: Toggle Key Lock"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:238
msgid ""
"**Configuration Options:** The noPlayOnSyncDoublePress option can be used to"
" turn off Play on Sync Double Press."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:241
msgid "27. Cue (Transport Control)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:243
msgid ""
"Behavior depends on the {ref}`cue mode <interface-cue-modes>` set in the "
"Mixxx preferences.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`CUE`: Return the play "
"head to the start of the track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:246
msgid "28. Play/Pause"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:248
msgid ""
"Starts and suspends playback. If no track is loaded, loads the   selected "
"track (if any) and play.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`PLAY/PAUSE`: "
"Stutter the track from the last set cue point.   If a cue point has not been"
" set, the play head will return to the   start of the track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:255
msgid "29. Performance Pads"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:257
msgid ""
"The top row of pads is for controlling loops and samples. To select a mode, "
"hold down the Pad Mode button and press one of the upper pads. An LED under "
"the pad section indicates the currently selected mode. See the subsections "
"below for details about each mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:262
msgid ""
"The bottom row of pads is used to trigger hotcue points. If a hotcue   point"
" has not already been set for the loaded track, this control will   mark the"
" hotcue point. If a hotcue point has already been set, this   control will "
"jump to it.<br> {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`HOTCUE`: Deletes the assigned "
"hotcue point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:268
msgid "Manual Loop Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:270
msgid ""
"Hold {hwlabel}`PADMODE` and press the pad marked Manual Loop (silkscreened "
"above the pad) to assign the lower 4 pads to the functions listed below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:273
msgid ""
"**Loop In** – Sets the beginning of a loop: When assigned, the Pad LED will "
"light blue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:275
msgid ""
"**Loop Out** – Sets the end point for the loop: When assigned, the Pad LED "
"will light blue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:277
msgid ""
"**On/Off** – (De)activate the loop. If a loop has not been set, this button "
"will have no effect.: When assigned, the Pad LED will light blue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:280
msgid ""
"**Loop x1/2** – Halve the length of the loop. Press {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + "
"**Loop x1/2** to double the length of the loop. x1/2 button is disabled "
"unless the corresponding deck is set to be quantized"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:285
msgid "Auto Loop Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:287
msgid ""
"Hold Pad Mode and press the pad marked Autoloop to assign the lower 4   pads"
" to the functions listed below: When assigned, the respective Pad   LED will"
" blink Yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:291
msgid "**Auto 1** – Sets and starts playback of a 2-beat autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:292
msgid "**Auto 2** – Sets and starts playback of a 4-beat autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:293
msgid "**Auto 3** – Sets and starts playback of a 8-beat autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:294
msgid "**Auto 4** – Sets and starts playback of a 16-beat autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:295
msgid ""
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+ Auto 1** – Sets and starts playback of a 1/8-beat "
"autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:296
msgid ""
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+ Auto 2** – Sets and starts playback of a 1/4-beat "
"autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:297
msgid ""
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+ Auto 3** – Sets and starts playback of a 1/2-beat "
"autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:298
msgid ""
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` **+ Auto 4** – Sets and starts playback of a 1-beat "
"autoloop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:300
msgid ""
"If the pad is held down more than .5 second (Long Press), the Autoloop will "
"be disabled once pad is released. On Short Press, the pad will behave as a "
"normal button (ON on first press, OFF on second press)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:304
msgid "Sample Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:306
msgid ""
"Hold Pad Mode and press the pad marked Sampler to assign the lower 4   pads "
"to the functions listed below. When assigned, the respective Pad   LED will "
"blink Purple Shift + Sample X will play loaded sample, but with Sampler unit"
" Sync   disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:312
msgid ""
"**Deck 1 - Sample 1** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 1 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:314
msgid ""
"**Deck 1 - Sample 2** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 2 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:316
msgid ""
"**Deck 1 - Sample 3** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 3 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:318
msgid ""
"**Deck 1 - Sample 4** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 4 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:320
msgid ""
"**Deck 2 - Sample 1** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 5 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:322
msgid ""
"**Deck 2 - Sample 2** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 6 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:324
msgid ""
"**Deck 2 - Sample 3** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 7 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:326
msgid ""
"**Deck 2 - Sample 4** – Plays the sample assigned to Sample Pad 8 with the "
"unit Sync activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:329
msgid ""
"If the pad is held down more than .5 second (Long Press), the sampler will "
"be disabled once pad is released. On Short Press, the pad will behave as a "
"normal button (ON on first press, OFF on second press)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:333
msgid "Load sample by selecting track and pressing **Sample X**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:334
msgid ""
"Pressing sample button when sample is already playing goes back to cue and "
"plays"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:336
msgid "Shift + sample to stop sample"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:337
msgid "Eject sample by {hwlabel}`TAP` + **Sample X**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/numark_mixtrack_pro_3.md:339
msgid "30. Master Output LEDs"
